WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:04.520
Ichika, are you sure you are okay?

00:04.930 --> 00:07.400
Yes, we're fine now.

00:07.400 --> 00:09.340
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:10.940 --> 00:12.170
Ichika...

00:13.340 --> 00:15.470
Please believe me when I say this.

00:15.980 --> 00:19.850
All of us... Satsuki... Keiko...

00:20.250 --> 00:22.010
Ichika, we...

00:25.190 --> 00:28.490
Michiru, thank you so much for today.

00:28.490 --> 00:29.750
Good night.

00:30.390 --> 00:31.760
Good night.

00:46.680 --> 00:50.040
I'm sorry, Father, Mother...

00:50.850 --> 00:52.040
Where's Ichika?

00:53.650 --> 00:55.120
Mother...

00:55.120 --> 00:56.820
What is it, Ichika dear?

00:56.820 --> 00:59.750
You don't have to call me "dear"
like that anymore...

01:02.160 --> 01:03.960
Sure, Ichika.

01:06.960 --> 01:09.690
She's growing up, little by little...

01:10.370 --> 01:11.330
Yes.

01:26.360 --> 01:33.560
Omoi wo ima hanadete hatenai asu ni kazasu yo

01:26.360 --> 01:33.560
I now play my feelings,
out to the endless tomorrow!

01:33.600 --> 01:40.310
Setsunai hodo mune utsu kagirinai kibou

01:33.600 --> 01:40.310
This unbounded hope that beats in my breast
to the point of melancholy

01:41.110 --> 01:48.910
Hakanasa wo masu hibi wo
irodoru wa kisetsu no kaze

01:41.110 --> 01:48.910
The days pass by, becoming more fleeting,
colored by the season's wind

01:48.950 --> 01:53.620
Kioku no kakera ga sawagidashita yo

01:48.950 --> 01:53.620
The fragments of memory started running wild

01:54.220 --> 02:02.620
Arinomama wo mitomete
haruka tsumuida hikari ga

01:54.220 --> 02:02.620
One more time, I want to hold the
spindle of far off light close to my breast,

02:02.670 --> 02:10.300
Kieru mae ni mou ichido
kono mune ni dakishimete

02:02.670 --> 02:10.300
Before it disappears, before
I accept the way things are now

02:12.380 --> 02:19.580
Omoi wo ima hanadete hatenai asu ni kazasu yo

02:12.380 --> 02:19.580
I now play my feelings,
out to the endless tomorrow!

02:19.580 --> 02:26.720
Mirai wo egaku ao ni kono te wo nobashite

02:19.580 --> 02:26.720
Hold out this hand to the blue-painted future

02:26.890 --> 02:34.020
Kasokushiteku sekai yo douka
yasashii mama de ite

02:26.890 --> 02:34.020
The world accelerates, please let it stay this kind

02:34.130 --> 02:41.630
Setsunai hodo mune utsu afuredasu negai

02:34.130 --> 02:41.630
This overflowing wish that beats in my breast
to the point of melancholy

02:48.600 --> 02:53.100
The Poetry of Fragments

03:02.880 --> 03:05.370
I knew it... This house is...

03:12.250 --> 03:13.450
Saya...

03:30.810 --> 03:34.040
Why is this here?

03:34.640 --> 03:38.050
Because it was mine originally.

03:39.150 --> 03:41.050
Saya?

03:49.460 --> 03:51.430
Who are you?

03:51.760 --> 03:53.760
That's a good question.

03:53.760 --> 03:55.500
I remember now.

03:55.500 --> 04:00.090
The house next door was empty
until the day before summer break!

04:00.470 --> 04:02.940
But you cast some illusion

04:02.940 --> 04:07.440
that made us think that you'd
lived there since long ago...

04:08.510 --> 04:11.410
All so that I could observe you carefully.

04:11.680 --> 04:12.410
Observe?

04:15.950 --> 04:17.320
Sei?

04:18.150 --> 04:19.990
No! Sei?

04:19.990 --> 04:21.060
Sei!

04:21.060 --> 04:23.190
Oh, no! This is my fault!

04:23.190 --> 04:23.750
No.

04:26.260 --> 04:28.820
Sei broke the rules.

04:29.730 --> 04:30.820
Kai?

04:31.370 --> 04:33.530
I brought her as you instructed.

04:33.540 --> 04:35.000
How obedient of you.

04:35.000 --> 04:36.940
Did no one notice?

04:36.940 --> 04:37.970
No.

04:37.970 --> 04:38.700
What was that?

04:40.580 --> 04:41.170
No, Ma'am.

04:41.480 --> 04:43.340
Kai, what's going on?

04:43.950 --> 04:48.140
You mustn't shout like that
in the middle of the night.

04:51.150 --> 04:55.520


04:57.530 --> 04:58.520
Kai...

05:00.530 --> 05:03.120
These children are my servants.

05:03.430 --> 05:05.060
They are a part of me.

05:05.970 --> 05:06.900
No...

05:08.240 --> 05:10.540
When I'm in this form...

05:10.540 --> 05:14.000
While I'm a person, I am myself...

05:14.610 --> 05:16.580
I am not yours!

05:16.580 --> 05:18.710
I am not part of you!

05:19.150 --> 05:21.910
Too bad. A penalty for you.

05:25.120 --> 05:26.350
Manatsu!

05:27.020 --> 05:32.290
You and these children are fated to be
touchstones for testing humans.

05:33.030 --> 05:34.730
A child of the trials.

05:34.730 --> 05:36.700
Child of the trials?

05:48.880 --> 05:51.180
A child who knows nothing...

05:51.180 --> 05:53.200
An adult whose heart has been soiled...

05:53.550 --> 05:56.320
Someone who exists as
neither one nor the other...

05:56.320 --> 05:57.580
A 14 year old.

05:58.420 --> 06:02.360
In that season I allow them to see the world
through the Djinn's eyes.

06:03.060 --> 06:05.580
How does the world look through those eyes?

06:06.190 --> 06:08.290
How do humans look to them?

06:08.930 --> 06:11.870
How do they feel about themselves?

06:15.170 --> 06:17.500
Humans lead such an ambiguous existence.

06:19.040 --> 06:23.510
The seven virtues that display
the beauty of heart and soul...

06:23.510 --> 06:27.040
If you flip them over, in a flash
they become the seven vices.

06:28.780 --> 06:31.910
A heart of kindness
goes back to back with wrath.

06:32.350 --> 06:35.090
Temperance is simply another face of pride.

06:35.520 --> 06:37.960
Diligence can be substituted for sloth.

06:37.960 --> 06:41.050
Sincerity will be beaten down by ambition.

06:41.600 --> 06:44.660
Reason and passion go to envy and lust.

06:45.000 --> 06:47.230
Proper wisdom becomes artifice.

06:47.970 --> 06:50.600
The unbalancing of your senses,

06:50.610 --> 06:53.270
manifests itself as overeating or lack of appetite.

06:54.010 --> 06:55.270
How sad...

06:55.840 --> 06:58.140
It was an even worse effect
than what happened to him.

06:58.980 --> 07:03.210
You become disillusioned by humans,
and start hating yourself...

07:10.730 --> 07:12.630
I would like you to choose.

07:13.230 --> 07:16.160
Shall I eliminate all of humanity
whom you have lost faith in?

07:17.330 --> 07:21.670
Or shall I eliminate you, yourself,
whom you've come to hate?

07:26.170 --> 07:28.170
Eliminate?

07:29.080 --> 07:32.180
A mirror reflects the world and the people in it.

07:32.180 --> 07:34.980
The beautiful, and the ugly...

07:34.980 --> 07:36.920
Which should it reflect?

07:36.920 --> 07:38.050
I don't understand.

07:38.050 --> 07:41.720
Saya, I don't understand
what you are talking about!

07:46.330 --> 07:48.020
I am the Djinn, Mirrora.

07:51.670 --> 07:55.770
I am to reflect the true form of all things.

07:55.770 --> 07:58.300
A representative for all that is in the world.

08:02.440 --> 08:06.410
Everyone in the world
wishes for things with beauty.

08:06.410 --> 08:09.720
There is no value in a mirror
that reflects the ugly.

08:09.720 --> 08:10.740
Is that not the case?

08:11.450 --> 08:15.590
I would like you, who has seen
through the eyes of all the Djinn, to decide.

08:15.590 --> 08:18.460
All humans, or you, alone...

08:19.130 --> 08:21.430
Who deserves to be eliminated?

08:22.260 --> 08:23.360
That's...

08:23.670 --> 08:26.570
Six years ago, he was not able to choose.

08:29.870 --> 08:33.270
Death awaits the fool who cannot answer.

08:33.580 --> 08:35.200
But, he...

08:36.810 --> 08:39.650
He refused to follow my orders.

08:39.650 --> 08:41.680
Kai?

08:41.680 --> 08:45.680
I instructed him to help the boy answer...

08:46.190 --> 08:47.960
I don't care what happens!

08:47.960 --> 08:50.050
I don't care if I can't go back to the way I was!

08:50.390 --> 08:54.660
Just... Please, just save his life!

08:55.260 --> 08:58.100
You wish to die in his place?

08:58.100 --> 09:00.800
To die and decompose as a human corpse?

09:02.300 --> 09:04.040
Kai, no!

09:04.040 --> 09:05.210
You can't die!

09:05.210 --> 09:07.110
I... I...

09:11.480 --> 09:15.980
Sei, if you want him to live,

09:16.180 --> 09:19.210
do you have the courage
to accept death yourself?

09:21.490 --> 09:22.050
Sei...

09:23.060 --> 09:26.190
They truly are mirror opposites...

09:30.430 --> 09:34.200
You really are all a complete set of fools.

09:34.200 --> 09:36.830
I have to choose one of the two?

09:37.140 --> 09:38.570
One from the two.

09:40.140 --> 09:43.880
Ichika, don't choose your own death!

09:43.880 --> 09:46.470
I won't...

09:56.090 --> 09:56.930
Ichika...

09:56.930 --> 09:58.260
I won't let you interfere.

09:59.230 --> 10:00.560
Manatsu!

10:04.700 --> 10:06.200


10:06.200 --> 10:07.640


10:07.640 --> 10:09.160


10:09.800 --> 10:11.140
Everyone...

10:11.510 --> 10:12.470
Ichika...

10:13.810 --> 10:15.830
Please believe me when I say this.

10:16.310 --> 10:19.650
All of us... Satsuki... Keiko...

10:19.650 --> 10:21.820
Ichika, we love you.

10:21.820 --> 10:26.480
And we'd like to come to love Manatsu as well.

10:34.830 --> 10:37.230
You are such a foolish child...

10:37.230 --> 10:38.330
Saya.

10:38.330 --> 10:40.170
This is my answer.

10:41.200 --> 10:42.860
I...

10:43.540 --> 10:44.770
Ichika...

10:46.040 --> 10:47.030
You can't choose?

10:49.840 --> 10:50.880
No.

10:50.880 --> 10:51.900
I won't choose!

10:56.780 --> 10:58.580
I have people that I love.

10:59.190 --> 11:01.450
I have people I'm not so good with...

11:02.760 --> 11:06.420
And I have a lot of things
that I hate about myself.

11:06.790 --> 11:10.130
I've even thrown trash on the roadside...

11:10.130 --> 11:12.800
But I want to live!

11:12.800 --> 11:14.060
I want to change myself!

11:14.870 --> 11:17.810
I want to change the me that feels jealous,

11:17.810 --> 11:22.210
and tells lies, who can't make decisions...

11:22.210 --> 11:23.510
I will change!

11:24.680 --> 11:27.940
If I don't, there's no reason to live!

11:29.220 --> 11:31.220
I'm sure everyone is the same.

11:31.220 --> 11:35.720
They wish to make themselves a little better
today than they were yesterday...

11:35.790 --> 11:37.880
I'm sure of it...

11:38.560 --> 11:41.060
Who I am now isn't everything.

11:41.060 --> 11:43.700
The world as it is now isn't everything.

11:43.700 --> 11:45.290
I want to believe it!

11:46.470 --> 11:49.870
I see. So that is your solution.

11:52.870 --> 11:55.400
I understand well how you feel.

11:56.780 --> 11:57.900
But...

11:58.550 --> 12:02.450
You have abandoned choosing one
of the two choices.

12:02.450 --> 12:04.190
That is a violation of the rules.

12:04.190 --> 12:05.380
You will receive a penalty.

12:16.200 --> 12:19.000
What do you think about Ichika lately?

12:19.900 --> 12:21.930
What is this all of a sudden?

12:22.500 --> 12:26.140
She's gotten so mature,
and listens to what we say.

12:26.140 --> 12:30.700
But I think at her age she should be
a little more selfish.

12:31.110 --> 12:34.550
Playing around with her friends,
getting in fights...

12:34.550 --> 12:36.880
Crying, laughing...

12:37.290 --> 12:39.490
Just like you were?

12:39.490 --> 12:40.820
Very funny.

12:41.690 --> 12:42.380
But...

12:43.360 --> 12:47.990
I think it's part of a parent's duty to listen
to the selfish requests of their children.

12:48.760 --> 12:49.820
Yes...

12:57.940 --> 13:00.530
Why, you...

13:05.110 --> 13:06.450
Manatsu!

13:06.450 --> 13:08.420
You are such a fool.

13:08.420 --> 13:10.540
You are a part of me.

13:10.890 --> 13:12.980
You cannot defy me.

13:22.860 --> 13:23.760
Ichika!

13:35.680 --> 13:36.270
Sei!

13:39.250 --> 13:40.370
Sei!

13:43.350 --> 13:45.650
If you're going to kill, then kill me!

13:45.650 --> 13:49.110
I'm the one that you wanted
to test originally, right?

13:49.460 --> 13:51.930
Sei, you...

13:51.930 --> 13:55.330
Your trial was six years ago.

13:55.330 --> 13:56.420
Now it is...

14:05.940 --> 14:07.600
I'm not scared...

14:08.280 --> 14:09.610
That's a lie.

14:13.480 --> 14:15.070
It doesn't hurt.

14:15.550 --> 14:17.380
You're fooling yourself.

14:25.030 --> 14:26.520
Even so...

14:47.580 --> 14:50.280
Ichika...

15:04.470 --> 15:05.360
Ichika...

15:16.180 --> 15:18.650
Humans are such foolish creatures.

15:19.650 --> 15:22.980
They shed crimson blood for no reason at all.

15:22.980 --> 15:23.780
You lie!

15:25.220 --> 15:27.420
You should be able to understand!

15:28.260 --> 15:30.990
You are a mirror spirit, like us.

15:31.760 --> 15:34.960
As our mother, as our elder sister, you...

15:34.960 --> 15:36.300
Silence!

15:36.300 --> 15:37.800
You are a part of me!

15:37.800 --> 15:39.290
You should know!

15:40.170 --> 15:43.200
The humans whose reflections we took...

15:43.200 --> 15:44.430
You should know how strong they are.

15:45.210 --> 15:48.230
You must know how strong a heart
exists within them!

15:48.910 --> 15:51.280
I... I...

15:52.350 --> 15:53.580
They make me proud.

15:54.480 --> 15:55.710
Fool.

15:56.280 --> 15:59.650
Far too foolish for the Djinn of Reflection.

15:59.650 --> 16:03.190
How important is reality? Is a mirror?

16:03.190 --> 16:08.150
Ichika said so... This instant isn't all of reality.

16:08.530 --> 16:12.260
People, and the world, they can change!

16:14.940 --> 16:15.770
What are you...

16:16.700 --> 16:18.070
And...

16:19.640 --> 16:21.670
My life as well...

16:22.140 --> 16:26.740
I believe... I can change it...

16:34.520 --> 16:39.550
I will also give back that which
I held for you, Sei.

16:44.730 --> 16:47.200
I've wanted to apologize to you all this time.

16:47.800 --> 16:51.430
Six years ago I drove you into a corner.

16:52.040 --> 16:53.310
I'm so sorry...

16:53.310 --> 16:57.040
I loved you...

17:19.700 --> 17:22.400
They're shedding tears?

17:23.140 --> 17:24.470
You foolish children...

17:32.450 --> 17:33.850
Manatsu...

17:34.850 --> 17:36.620
Ichi... ka...

17:36.620 --> 17:37.850
Manatsu!

17:39.850 --> 17:41.190
Don't worry.

17:41.190 --> 17:43.520
Yes, this is a dream.

17:44.290 --> 17:45.920
All you have to do is open your eyes.

17:46.630 --> 17:47.790
And you'll forget all of this.

17:47.800 --> 17:50.390
Manatsu... I...

17:51.930 --> 17:54.400
Good night, Ichika.

17:57.140 --> 17:58.240
No!

17:58.240 --> 18:01.110
If I do that, then you'll...

18:01.110 --> 18:02.410
Manatsu...

18:03.610 --> 18:04.670
Ichika...

18:12.820 --> 18:14.580
This isn't a dream.

18:15.490 --> 18:17.120
This is reality.

18:17.690 --> 18:20.290
I... I...

18:20.700 --> 18:22.030
I'll never forget!

19:11.780 --> 19:13.370
Connect me to him.

19:15.050 --> 19:18.220
No, good work.

19:18.220 --> 19:20.190
I saw how things unfolded.

19:20.190 --> 19:23.390
This was quite intriguing, yes?

19:23.390 --> 19:27.890
I apologize. I again did not receive
a satisfactory answer.

19:29.030 --> 19:32.360
Well, perhaps that was for the best this time.

19:32.930 --> 19:36.940
There hasn't been many in a while,
but that was a correct answer.

19:36.940 --> 19:40.840
Or rather for her, it is better called
a model answer.

19:40.840 --> 19:46.970
To deny the type of person you are is the same
as denying your very self.

19:48.250 --> 19:50.510
It's quite an unfair quiz, yes!

19:50.820 --> 19:52.250
I apologize.

19:56.090 --> 19:58.990
But you are also quite the liar.

19:59.730 --> 20:02.990
Mirrors do not always reflect reality.

20:03.400 --> 20:08.460
You know full well a mirror can only
be trusted as much as it's warped!

20:09.100 --> 20:11.700
Are you referring to me?

20:13.440 --> 20:18.110
That is why I seek the true, strict reality.

20:19.310 --> 20:22.720
You are so stubborn, as always.

20:22.720 --> 20:25.080
Even though you are far more
sensitive than humans.

20:26.690 --> 20:29.090
I will not allow the rules to be violated.

20:30.960 --> 20:33.290
Well then, shall we move on to the next?

20:35.230 --> 20:36.090
Yes.

21:01.090 --> 21:07.590
I have a feeling like fall mornings
are similar to summer evenings.

21:08.400 --> 21:11.700
When I'm enveloped in this light,

21:12.570 --> 21:15.870
memories of her spring up in my mind.

21:17.240 --> 21:20.940
Ichika, you'll be late for school!

21:20.940 --> 21:22.070
Coming!

21:23.610 --> 21:29.240
Memories of that girl who disappeared
along with the summer...

21:31.790 --> 21:35.780
I'll be heading to your father's place
on the afternoon flight.

21:36.060 --> 21:38.320
I'll be back in a week.

21:38.330 --> 21:40.930
I'll be all right by myself.

21:40.930 --> 21:44.520
You're worried about Dad
living by himself in Italy, right?

21:46.100 --> 21:49.440
Enough with the smart mouth.
Head along to school.

21:49.440 --> 21:50.740
It's the Cultural Festival today, yes?

21:50.740 --> 21:51.710
Okay!

21:52.070 --> 21:58.810
I wonder if the life that resides within me
is really only my own...

21:59.350 --> 22:00.580
Perhaps it is...

22:02.320 --> 22:04.250
Good morning.

22:04.250 --> 22:05.390
Good morning.

22:05.390 --> 22:06.510
So, let's go.

22:07.790 --> 22:09.450
Roger!

22:13.760 --> 22:15.390
Good morning.

22:17.670 --> 22:18.500
Good morning.

22:28.880 --> 22:29.900
What's the matter?

22:30.210 --> 22:31.680
I feel sorry for them...

22:31.680 --> 22:32.650
For who?

22:32.950 --> 22:36.780
Snow White, and the Queen, and the mirror...

22:36.780 --> 22:38.120
Why?

22:38.650 --> 22:42.290
The mirror couldn't help but reflect the truth.

22:42.290 --> 22:45.990
Because of that, the mother and daughter
fought each other.

22:47.330 --> 22:49.060
You're very kind.

22:50.660 --> 22:51.800
Thank you.

22:51.800 --> 22:55.430
But I will show it to you as well.

22:56.540 --> 22:59.770
We are always being watched.

23:01.440 --> 23:03.710
We are always being tested.

23:05.150 --> 23:06.340
By nature...

23:08.650 --> 23:09.950
By the world...

23:14.220 --> 23:16.710
But, it's okay.

23:29.100 --> 23:34.600
If you can love the you that's reflected
in the mirror, then surely...
